# sliced output is regenerated by `task hw:case:slice`; only the summaries and logs are kept
slice/*.gcode
slice/*.bgcode
__pycache__/
.pytest_cache/
# the STEP exports regenerate with the case export task, and the working logs are not kept
out/*.step
out/logs/
# the renders are generated by `task hw:case:views` and `task hw:case:directions` (the tests draw their own into a temporary folder);
# only the two sheets, the logo preview (the owner-held logo raster is not in the repository, so it cannot be redrawn) and the lit pictures are kept
renders/*.png
renders/directions/*.png
!renders/directions/contact-sheet.png
!renders/directions/logo-sheet.png
!renders/directions/logo-preview.png
